<title>USA: Dell Computer Q4 Feb 2 net rises.</title>
<headline>Dell Computer Q4 Feb 2 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>ROUND ROCK, Texas 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Call Q4 estimate was $0.83 per share.</p>
<p>			(in millions, except per share data)</p>
<p>				   Q4 FY'97  Q4 FY'96   FY'97   FY'96</p>
<p> Net Sales			 $2,412   $1,539   $7,759  $5,296</p>
<p> Operating Income		   250	 94	714     377</p>
<p> Net Income			   188	 70	518     272</p>
<p> Earnings Per Share(A)	   1.01	.35     2.77    1.34</p>
<p> Weighted Avg. Shares O/S(A)  185.8    198.7    191.8   194.2</p>
<p>NOTE(A): Before extraordinary charges; adjusted for a two-for-one stock split effective Dec. 6, 1996.</p>
</text>
